mount-manager (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
    - Mount, unmount and inspect SMB/CIFS, NFS, SSHFS/SFTP, WebDAV, FTP,
      block devices and bind mounts from a GTK4/libadwaita window.
    - Network discovery through Avahi/mDNS, share and export listing,
      connection testing with actionable error messages.
    - Saved shares, optional /etc/fstab persistence with automatic backups,
      GNOME keyring integration and Files sidebar bookmarks.
    - Privilege escalation via polkit (pkexec) with an in-app sudo password
      prompt fallback for containers and minimal sessions.
    - Command line interface (list, mount, umount, devices, shares, fstab,
      discover, auto-mount) and bash completion.

 -- Mount Manager maintainers <maintainer@example.com>  Mon, 21 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0930
